{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b71a2be6-b9e1-8fa3-96ca-b71e09ae8333",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T10:44:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:38:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Nancy Wilcox. I call about noise. Neighbor noise, music."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Wilcox. A neighbor's music. Let me make sure I have that. Can you tell me a little more about what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The neighbor, he play loud music every weekend. Every weekend, very loud. And this week it start Monday. Since Monday, not only weekend. Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, today also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's gone on since Monday this week, and it's been happening on weekends before that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:39:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Weekend before, and weekend before that. Now is Thursday and still [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up there. Could you say that last part again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I say, now is Thursday and still he play. Four days. Four days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four days. Thank you. And where is this happening? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is 403 Broadway. Four-oh-three Broadway. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-three Broadway. Is that your address, or the neighbor's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is the place where the music is. I am the neighbor next door. I do not give my address, only that one, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I have 403 Broadway as the source of the noise. I'll write that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I want to ask, what are the quiet hours? What time must be quiet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Hang on a moment, let me make sure I give you the right information. Can you hold for me just a minute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:41:06-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Thanks for waiting, Ms. Wilcox. So in general the city has quiet hours at night, when loud noise isn't allowed. It's in the evening through the early morning. I don't have the exact clock times in front of me, so I'd rather not give you the wrong hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. So you do not know the time? I need the time. My sister, she ask me to find out. She say, Nancy, call and find out, then call me back with answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. The exact hours are in the city's noise ordinance. The police department handles noise complaints too, and they would know the hours. I can have someone from our office call you back with the specific times, if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Call back is better. Because my phone [line breaks up] not good here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the line has been cutting out. Let me take your number. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0165. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-five. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Zero-one-six-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And I'll note the callback is about the quiet hours, and your complaint about loud music at 403 Broadway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I want to say, this is very annoying. Every weekend I cannot rest. And now Monday also. Too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:43:05-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that sounds like a real nuisance. If it's loud right now, you can also call the police non-emergency line so an officer can come out. That would be separate from what I'm doing here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The police, they come same day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise how fast, it depends on what else is going on. But a call while it's happening is the way to get someone out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think about that. First I need the hours for my sister."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:43:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I'll pass along the request, and someone should call you back today or tomorrow. If you don't hear from us, call again and ask for me, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:44:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Owen. Okay. Today or tomorrow. You write my name? Nancy Wilcox. W-I-L-C-O-X."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:44:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "W-I-L-C-O-X. Got it. Nancy Wilcox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Okay, thank you. Bye-bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:44:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for calling, Ms. Wilcox. Take care."
    }
  ],
